        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>被甲伏怪&amp;Reference[condition=grappled]{擒抱}的生物必须进行一次[[/save ability=con dc=13]]的豁免，豁免失败则&amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]{中毒}1分钟。该中毒期间目标生物陷入&amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed]{麻痹}。该目标可以在每个其自己回合结束时再进一次该豁免，豁免成功则终止该效应。</p><p>One creature &amp;Reference[condition=grappled] by the chuul must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=13]] saving throw or be &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] for 1 minute. Until this poison ends, the target is &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed]. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p></div>",
